{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1417011411"}, "name":{"label":"ATkac23"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-13T23:12:50-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.6.1"}, "id":{"label":"14180647193"}, "title":{"label":"Use it extensively but…"}, "content":{"label":"The app itself is beautiful, it’s fun, and it’s intuitive. I love having both the more advanced features that I’d expect in more professional products such as ensemble, and SPC integrations while also having the whimsy and keeping weather fun. My only wish is that more advanced integrations continue being added such as sounding plots, being able to further refine the ensemble models, and GOES imagery. Being able to have the app as a one stop shop for all weather products would seal the deal for me as being the greatest weather app of all time (the GWAOAT🌦️🐐)", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
