{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id356037370"}, "name":{"label":"Mgrad92"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-27T08:17:05-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.5"}, "id":{"label":"14112221388"}, "title":{"label":"Very well done"}, "content":{"label":"It’s difficult for any app to balance ease of use with custom features, and Carrot Weather does a great job. \n\nDesigners and developers have made good decisions here for users who want to use this app off the shelf, but it’s still possible to adjust those decisions (❤️ customized Watch complications!) without rocket surgery. \n\nI’ve been using Carrot Weather for a while now, and I continue to discover features in it that have let me delete other “free” weather apps I’m pretty sure I was paying for with leaked location data.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
